  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.1.0.0 (2026-11-24): Removed support for Net8.0 as it is out of support, added support for Net11.0, updated NuGet packages, the calendars are found through the calendar home set of the principal now (fixes SOGo), the event query filters on VEVENT, calendar data is decoded before it reaches Ical.Net, added GetEvents with a time range. The new public API is why the minor version is raised.",
